---
Print a shell completion script to stdout

Usage: rslbp completion <SHELL>

Arguments:
  <SHELL>
          Target shell (`bash`, `zsh`, `fish`, `elvish`, `powershell`)
          
          [possible values: bash, elvish, fish, powershell, zsh]

Options:
  -h, --help
          Print help
